-- MasterMounts: records that have no location BECAUSE there is none.
--
-- A blank coordinate meant two different things and the addon could not
-- tell them apart: "we failed to find this" and "there is nothing to
-- find". Both read as a gap, so the completeness figure was unexplained
-- rather than honest, and the router filed a Blizzard Shop mount as a
-- routing failure.
--
-- ONLY categories with genuinely nowhere to travel are listed. Trading
-- Post, PvP, Currency and Reputation mounts all name real vendors in real
-- places -- those stay counted as gaps, because they are gaps. Marking
-- them here would hide missing work behind a reassuring label.
local _, MM = ...

MM.OverrideMount("Acherus Deathcharger", { noLocationReason = "Class mount -- learned automatically or from your own trainer" })
MM.OverrideMount("Albino Drake", { noLocationReason = "Achievement reward -- granted on completion, nowhere to travel" })
